# Keys, certificates and archives must never be committed. These are not files
# the project ships; the patterns exist so that a key generated while testing
# in a working copy cannot be swept up by `git add .`.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.cer
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
node_modules/
